<main class="drink-page">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="drink-hero">
    <div class="drink-hero-content">
      <p class="drink-eyebrow">BIPOLAR SOBER / RESOURCES</p>

      <h1 class="drink-title">
        <span>so you</span>
        <span>want to</span>
        <span>drink?</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="drink-subtitle">
        Okay. Remember when...
      </p>

      <a href="#remember" class="drink-button">
        REMEMBER ↓
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- 01 -->
  <section class="memory-section memory-pink" id="remember">
    <div class="memory-heading">
      <p class="memory-number">01 / REMEMBER WHEN...</p>
      <h2>YOU LOST<br>YOURSELF.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="memory-list">
      <p>...you lost your sense of self?</p>
      <p>...you were filled with doubt?</p>
      <p>...you were filled with fear of abandonment?</p>
      <p>...you had such low self-esteem and were such a pessimist?</p>
      <p>...you tried to put the word <strong>"loser"</strong> on a collage about yourself?</p>
      <p>...you wrote some of the worst things about yourself in those journals?</p>
      <p>...you felt "askew"?</p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- 02 -->
  <section class="memory-section memory-black">
    <div class="memory-heading">
      <p class="memory-number">02 / REMEMBER WHEN...</p>
      <h2>YOU WAITED.<br>AND WAITED.<br>AND WAITED.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="memory-list">
      <p>...you enjoyed watching the clock move?</p>
      <p>...you eagerly awaited responses to text messages but none came?</p>
      <p>...nobody sent you mail?</p>
      <p>...the phone calls were only fifteen minutes?</p>
      <p>...you were always waiting for the next thing: mail, text messages, meals, medications?</p>
      <p>...you were constantly wondering about the outside world?</p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- 03 -->
  <section class="memory-section memory-yellow">
    <div class="memory-heading">
      <p class="memory-number">03 / REMEMBER WHEN...</p>
      <h2>THIS WAS<br>YOUR LIFE.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="memory-list">
      <p>...you celebrated jail Thanksgiving, Christmas, and your birthday?</p>
      <p>...you ate beans, chili, bologna, Fritos, peanut butter, and hotdogs exclusively?</p>
      <p>...you were mixing disgusting food to make it taste better?</p>
      <p>...everyone smelled bad?</p>
      <p>...people passed gas and crop dusted?</p>
      <p>...those girls cheated at Spades?</p>
      <p>...there were mooches everywhere?</p>
      <p>...people were incredibly rude for no reason?</p>
      <p>...people were very self-centered and selfish?</p>
      <p>...everyone around you gossiped and backstabbed?</p>
      <p>...it was so loud you couldn't think?</p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- 04 -->
  <section class="memory-section memory-pink">
    <div class="memory-heading">
      <p class="memory-number">04 / REMEMBER WHEN...</p>
      <h2>YOU WERE<br>NOT FREE.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="memory-list">
      <p>...you were strip searched?</p>
      <p>...you were treated unfairly by the guards?</p>
      <p>...you were in gen pop and were in those 22-hour lockdowns?</p>
      <p>...you slept on those "beds" and got incredibly bad back pain from them?</p>
      <p>...you had people waking you up?</p>
      <p>...you had to rely on others outside for everything: food, commissary, sciatica, phone?</p>
      <p>...everyone found out your problems and your crimes?</p>
      <p>...you missed out on the kids growing up?</p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- 05 -->
  <section class="memory-section memory-black">
    <div class="memory-heading">
      <p class="memory-number">05 / REMEMBER WHEN...</p>
      <h2>YOUR BRAIN<br>WAS NOT<br>OKAY.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="memory-list">
      <p>...you got jailbrain and began to forget basic information?</p>
      <p>...you had depressive and manic episodes in jail?</p>
      <p>...you always had to listen to stories glorifying drugs and alcohol?</p>
      <p>...you had to hear how great being homeless was?</p>
      <p>...you wanted to "suffocate and kill" your hope?</p>
      <p>...you missed people so much it hurt?</p>
      <p>...you had perpetual loneliness?</p>
      <p>...you were just simply hopeless?</p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- END -->
  <section class="drink-ending">
    <p class="ending-small">SO...</p>

    <h2>
      YOU STILL<br>
      WANT THAT<br>
      <span>DRINK?</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="ending-message">
      <p>REMEMBER ALL OF THIS</p>
      <p>BEFORE YOU TAKE THAT DRINK.</p>

      <a href="/" class="ending-button">
        CHOOSE DIFFERENTLY →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>